<view class="page">
  <view class="title">我的房间</view>
  <view class="muted">使用同一微信账号可跨设备找回所有仍有权限房间。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card muted">正在同步你的云端房间…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{cloudError}}" class="card cloud-error">{{cloudError}}；为保护账号隐私，未显示本机缓存。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !rooms.length}}" class="card muted">还没有可访问的房间，可从首页创建或输入房间码加入。</view>

  <view
    wx:for="{{rooms}}"
    wx:key="docId"
    class="card trip-row"
    bindtap="open"
    data-id="{{item.docId}}"
    data-type="{{item.room.toolType}}"
  >
    <view class="trip-icon">{{item.typeIcon}}</view>
    <view class="trip-copy">
      <view class="trip-name">{{item.room.name}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.typeLabel}} · 房间码 {{item.room.code}}</view>
      <view class="trip-meta">{{item.memberCount || 0}} 位成员 · {{item.expenseCount || 0}} 笔支出</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="btn load-more" bindtap="loadMore" loading="{{loadingMore}}" disabled="{{loadingMore}}">{{loadingMore ? '加载中…' : '加载更多'}}</button>
</view>
